CM_ "Receive-only subset from local T9 captures. Signal layouts partly derived from commaai/opendbc psa_aee2010_r3.dbc revision a0febba355168a5cb6168b535144c8c41a5ce323, Copyright (c) 2020 Comma.ai, Inc., MIT License.";
CM_ SG_ 520 AcceleratorPositionPct "Legacy signal name: calculated engine accelerator demand, NOT physical pedal presence. RVV can keep this nonzero while the 0x228 pedal is released. Do not use for gasPressed.";
CM_ BO_ 552 "OBD Dyn5_CMM.P334_ACCPed_Position. T9 DLC is 8, not the R3 DBC's 5. All 313421 bus-0 frames in the two 2026-09-17 routes have nibble sum 3 modulo 16; byte 3 low checksum/high counter.";
CM_ SG_ 552 AcceleratorPedalPct "Physical pedal channel already decoded by the OBD tool. Raw 0 is released; raw above 200 is outside the valid percentage range and must not be treated as released.";
CM_ SG_ 520 CruiseStateCandidate "Vehicle-observed state. Active is derived as raw value 2; it is not an official PSA enum.";
CM_ BO_ 757 "Steering torque frame protection was validated over 933226 local frames: checksum in byte 0 high nibble, rolling counter in byte 0 low nibble, CHK_INI=0xB, zero mismatches.";
CM_ SG_ 757 DriverTorqueRaw "Direction and dynamics validated on the vehicle. No physical Nm scale has been established, therefore the unit remains raw.";
CM_ SG_ 773 SteeringAngleDeg "Scale and direction validated on the vehicle.";
CM_ SG_ 773 SteeringRateMagnitudeDegS "Validated rate magnitude. Signed steering rate must be derived using SteeringRateSign: sign 1 means negative in the local replay.";
CM_ BO_ 781 "All four wheel speeds validated together over a road capture; mean inter-wheel spread 0.86 km/h.";
CM_ BO_ 941 "ESP EasyMove frame. ParkingBrakeState and frame protection are source-confirmed and locally observed. CHECKSUM/COUNTER: 480554 frames, CHK_INI=0xD, zero mismatches.";
CM_ SG_ 941 ParkingBrakeState "Observed counts over the checksum-valid corpus: state 0=405148, 1=74389, 2=496, 3=521. Source semantics confirm 0 released, 1 applied and 3 actuator moving; state 2 remains reserved/transition.";
CM_ SG_ 973 YawRateDegS "Scale and direction validated against steering and wheel-speed differential.";
CM_ BO_ 973 "Brake dynamics protection was checked over 961914 local frames with CHK_INI=0x3; 961913 passed and one isolated frame was a corrupt/outlier.";
CM_ SG_ 1042 DriverDoorOpen "Source-confirmed at Dat_BSI.DRIVER_DOOR (byte 6 mask 0x08). Both closed and open states were observed locally; five learn sessions contain transitions.";
CM_ SG_ 1042 RearLeftDoorOpen "Undocumented byte 6 mask 0x20, confirmed by repeated closed-open-closed tests on the rear-left door.";
CM_ SG_ 1042 RearRightDoorOpen "Undocumented byte 6 mask 0x40, confirmed by repeated closed-open-closed tests on the rear-right door.";
CM_ SG_ 1294 CruiseSetpointKph "Confirmed over five cruise engagements in four independent tests. Raw 255 means inactive/unavailable.";
CM_ SG_ 1294 CruiseMode "Validated during learn-20260805T065418Z-fca10a57: the selector sequence cruise-off-limiter-off-cruise produced 1-0-2-0-1.";
CM_ SG_ 1394 DriverSeatbeltState "Vehicle-validated on learn-20260805T154951Z-57acfc99 at standstill: 2-1-2-1-2 while DriverDoorOpen and ParkingBrakeActive stayed false. Seven local sessions contain 1/2 transitions; road captures support 1=unlatched and 2=latched. Values 0 and 3 remain reserved/unknown.";
VAL_ 520 CruiseStateCandidate 0 "Inactive_observed" 2 "Active_observed" 3 "Transient_observed";
VAL_ 773 SteeringRateSign 0 "Positive_local_replay" 1 "Negative_local_replay";
VAL_ 1042 ReverseGearActive 0 "Inactive" 1 "Active";
VAL_ 1042 BrakePedalActive 0 "Released" 1 "Pressed";
VAL_ 1042 DriverDoorOpen 0 "Closed" 1 "Open";
VAL_ 1042 PassengerDoorOpen 0 "Closed" 1 "Open";
VAL_ 1042 RearLeftDoorOpen 0 "Closed" 1 "Open";
VAL_ 1042 RearRightDoorOpen 0 "Closed" 1 "Open";
VAL_ 941 ParkingBrakeState 0 "Released" 1 "Applied" 2 "Reserved_or_transition" 3 "Actuator_moving";
VAL_ 1106 TurnSignalStatus 0 "Off" 1 "Right" 2 "Left" 3 "Hazard";
VAL_ 1294 CruiseSetpointKph 255 "Inactive_or_unavailable";
VAL_ 1294 CruiseMode 0 "Off" 1 "Cruise_RVV" 2 "Limiter_LVV" 3 "Reserved";
VAL_ 1394 DriverSeatbeltState 0 "Unknown_or_reserved" 1 "Unlatched" 2 "Latched" 3 "Unknown_or_reserved";

CM_ SG_ 840 CurrentGear "Same high-nibble decode as the OBD tool, verified on both 2026-09-17 routes: 1..6 forward, 9 reverse, 0 no forward ratio. No low-nibble compatibility fallback is used for vehicle control.";
CM_ SG_ 841 TargetGear "Requested ratio, not the engaged ratio. Codes 10 and 15 are observed transition/unavailable values and are not interpreted as a forward gear.";
VAL_ 840 CurrentGear 0 "No_forward_ratio" 1 "First" 2 "Second" 3 "Third" 4 "Fourth" 5 "Fifth" 6 "Sixth" 9 "Reverse";
